---
title: Dev Validation Test
---

This is an internal page for examples that cannot be published to the public docs because they
recreate the chart from a button handler, a pattern the framework example generator cannot
translate to React, Angular, or Vue. See the public `dev-validation` page for the framework-compatible
validation examples.

## Throwing on Validation Issues

What to test:

- With `throwOn: ['warning']` selected, clicking "Apply Invalid Options" logs `chart created`, the chart
  re-renders with the invalid option falling back, and an uncaught `AG Charts - validations.throwOn: warning - ...`
  error follows, which the page's `error` listener logs as `uncaught: ...`.
- With `throwOn: []` selected, clicking "Apply Invalid Options" logs `chart created` only.

